<!--
  Entitlements for the main executable (Contents/MacOS/kingu-desktop): intentionally empty.
  WKWebView's JavaScript JIT runs in Apple's WebContent XPC service, which carries its own
  entitlements, so the app needs no cs.allow-jit. No App Sandbox (an IDE spawns shells, git,
  language servers and agents in arbitrary folders). Never add disable-library-validation,
  allow-dyld-environment-variables or allow-unsigned-executable-memory (docs/PLAN.md 7.2).
  The agent host sidecar has its own file: agent-host.plist.
-->
